  "final_message": "I've started checking the git status and repository files.\nI am listing the repository files to inspect where `OrderPlaced` and its fields are defined and used.\nI'll wait for the task listing the files to complete.\nI am waiting for the unit test run to complete.\nI am waiting for the tests to finish running.\nI am checking references to schemaVersion.\nI am checking references to ARCH-4 across the repository.\nI am checking the architecture rule validation output.\nI will wait for the architecture rule validation to finish.\nI am waiting for `npm test` to finish.\nI will wait for the test execution to complete.\nI am waiting for `npm run typecheck` to finish.\nI will wait for the typecheck command to finish.\nI will wait for the architecture check to finish.\nI will wait for the architecture check to complete.\nIn accordance with architecture rule **ARCH-4** (changes to published domain events must be additive, with renames proceeding through deprecation so deployed consumers like `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest` are not broken):\n\n1. **Updated [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L36)**:\n   - Added `createdAt` (ISO-8601 timestamp) and marked `placedAt` with `@deprecated`.\n   - Added `amountCents` (integer minor units) and marked `totalCents` with `@deprecated`.\n2. **Updated [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L73)**:\n   - Emits both `createdAt` and `placedAt` with `order.placedAt`.\n   - Emits both `amountCents` and `totalCents` with `totalCents(order)`.\n3. **Updated Tests**:\n   - [`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/test/app.test.ts#L21-L54): Verified that published `OrderPlaced` events include `createdAt` and `amountCents` alongside the deprecated fields.\n   - [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w4/r/test/adapters.test.ts#L47-L54): Verified wire serialization in `KafkaEventPublisher`.\n",
